{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DOMiNi</i> is a roguelike puzzle game that combines strategic placement of dominoes with a minimalist dungeon crawler experience. Connect dominoes to build paths, collect loot, and avoid deadly monsters as you progress through an increasingly challenging dungeon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 unlockable classes</strong> with different sets of rules and dominoes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>21 procedurally generated levels</strong>, each one more difficult than the last</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ tiles to discover,</strong> all with their own unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ shop items</strong> to improve your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic gameplay, where every move counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3401030?t=1760536389","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3401030?t=1760536389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401030/4815c6d00caeb2a252a4b32888decd9ef61f54ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760536389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401030/4815c6d00caeb2a252a4b32888decd9ef61f54ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760536389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_des